From 7d518cfe8bb1e26bc476eea04cabb3f156b28f60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shibco <cade@parare.al>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 23:38:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 100/100] winealsa: make MIDI topology dynamic and recover
 hotplug

Track ALSA sequencer changes after WinMM initialization and publish coherent, stable endpoint snapshots. Preserve open handles across reconnect, clean interrupted input state, and notify hosts after publication.

Teach WinMM to refresh MIDI mappings without invalidating open handles, and retain zero-device drivers so devices appearing later can be enumerated.

Refs #46.
